sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Retrieval service
    participant B as Context builder
    participant M as Answer model
    participant V as Backend validator
    participant C as Conversation store
    participant U as User interface

    R->>B: Final evidence chunks with provenance
    B->>B: Assign S1, S2, ... and enforce context budget
    B->>M: Untrusted labelled context + question
    M-->>V: Answer text containing candidate markers such as [S1]
    V->>V: Keep only identifiers assigned to supplied chunks
    V->>C: Persist answer and bounded source snapshots
    C-->>U: Answer plus authoritative source metadata
    U->>U: Open source details by validated identifier

